<v Woman 1>I can't believe a handsome kid like you belongs to him.
<v Woman 1>我不敢相信像你这么帅的孩子居然是他生的。

00:52:39.850 --> 00:52:42.440
<v Nick's Father>It was the mother. The mother was beautiful. I was lucky.
<v Nick's Father>那是母亲的功劳。母亲很漂亮。我很幸运。

00:52:42.440 --> 00:52:53.750
<v Nick Flynn>He was very proud that this is my son. And no one really believed that he had a son. I said, yeah, I was his son. And he bragged to people that I was working at Columbia University.
<v Nick Flynn>他非常自豪，这是我儿子。真的没人相信他有儿子。我说，是啊，我是他儿子。他向别人吹嘘我在哥伦比亚大学工作。

00:52:53.750 --> 00:52:54.630
<v Nick Flynn>What's your name?
<v Nick Flynn>你叫什么名字？

