<v Nick Flynn>Walter. Nice to meet you, Walter.
<v Nick Flynn>沃尔特。很高兴见到你，沃尔特。

00:52:56.170 --> 00:53:01.280
<v Nick's Father>He teaches at Columbia University. My kid. Imagine that. For writing.
<v Nick's Father>他在哥伦比亚大学教书。我的孩子。想象一下。教写作。

