<v Walter>That's a miracle.
<v Walter>那真是个奇迹。

00:53:03.920 --> 00:53:08.730
<v Nick's Father>Well again, his mother had brains. I got to get another coffee. How old are you anyway?
<v Nick's Father>好吧，还是那句话，他母亲有脑子。我得再去弄杯咖啡。你到底多大了？

