<v Nick Flynn>I'm 35.
<v Nick Flynn>我35岁。

00:53:09.780 --> 00:53:10.710
<v Nick's Father>Are you that old?
<v Nick's Father>你老了吗？

00:53:10.710 --> 00:53:11.970
<v Nick Flynn>Yeah, 35.
<v Nick Flynn>是啊，35岁。

00:53:11.970 --> 00:53:13.640
<v Nick's Father>When's the last time I saw you?
<v Nick's Father>我上次见你是什么时候？

